From 8500f0ba55bc3b72379be77e8801eb04d1a0677e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 16:06:56 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 02/10] Add Seer web UI: catalog search, request button and
 requests page

A "Requests" sidebar entry (when Seer.Enabled) searches MusicBrainz, plays
owned items, requests missing ones and lists requests with admin approval.
The list refreshes via the event stream.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>

