+## Web UI
+
+When `Seer.Enabled` is on, a **Requests** entry appears in the sidebar (`#/seer`):
+a search box over the MusicBrainz catalog (owned items get Play/Open, missing
+ones a Request button, requested ones their live status) and the requests list,
+where admins approve pending requests or retry failed ones. The list refreshes
+by itself through the server event stream (`refreshResource` for `seer`).
+Code: `ui/src/seer/`; strings under `resources.seer` (English and pt-BR).
+
